{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Scourges is a linear and dark third person shooter mixed with tactical elements. You embody the captain of a special strike team consisting of four elite operators. Shoot, loot, craft and use your team to survive the unknown horror lurking in the depths of an underground research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHED LIGHT INTO THE DARK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.poster.avif?t=1766338336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.webm?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.mp4?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're send to a mysterious underground facility and have to investigate a leak from one of your contact persons. The deeper you descend, the more truth unveils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIRD PERSON COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.poster.avif?t=1766338336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.webm?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.mp4?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target your enemies with the classic over-the-shoulder perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TEAM IS YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.poster.avif?t=1766338336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.webm?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.mp4?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving your teammates efficient orders will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPON ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.poster.avif?t=1766338336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.webm?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.mp4?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of pistols, SMGs, shotguns, assault rifles, snipers and special weapons such as a flamethrower and even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.poster.avif?t=1766338336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.webm?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.mp4?t=1766338336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine and choose your components and make decisions on what to take and what to leave.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2198250?t=1766338336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/82d87353715b783cc66f22d65372ec78f927c917/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766338336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/3a22d7811b6a08ee9e6e133b906d47655607972b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766338336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/3a22d7811b6a08ee9e6e133b906d47655607972b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766338336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Death Scourges features stylized depictions of bloody violence, decapitation and body horror."},"demos":[{"appid":2286310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Scourges is a linear and dark third person shooter mixed with tactical elements. You embody the captain of a special strike team consisting of four elite operators. Shoot, loot, craft and use your team to survive the unknown horror lurking in the depths of an underground resea